<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Sunshine and rain,</l><l>Ice, fog, and snow,</l><l>Come from above,</l><l>God made it so.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Seeds scattered, sown,</l><l>Sprout up and grow,</l><l>Fruits are produced,</l><l>God made it so.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Seasons for us,</l><l>Rain to play in,</l><l>Fruits to enjoy,</l><l>God made it so.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
